# Float subtraction of exactly representable values

Subtracts 1.5 from 2.25 to verify native single-precision subtraction for
values exactly representable in f32, producing 0.75.

>>> source
float_left: float = 1.5
float_right: float = 2.25

float_diff: float = float_right - float_left
print(float_diff)

<<< stdout
0.75

<<< stderr
